1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:03,289
Football stories don't end with the scoreline.

2
00:00:03,309 --> 00:00:10,137
Pivot ingests a synthetic match event by event, every pass, shot and tackle, and renders it beside the action.

3
00:00:10,137 --> 00:00:14,654
A fan sees the pitch, who's on top right now, and the big moments.

4
00:00:15,100 --> 00:00:26,562
Switch to Analyst, and the same match becomes a live data centre: expected goals, field tilt, pressing and possession over the last ten minutes, with shape, pressing zones and passing lanes on the pitch.

5
00:00:27,400 --> 00:00:32,141
Pivot turns the events into momentum, and flags the minutes where the game swung.

6
00:00:32,161 --> 00:00:36,842
A Judge agent on Azure AI Foundry decides if it's a real turning point.

7
00:00:36,842 --> 00:00:39,166
An Explainer writes why.

8
00:00:39,166 --> 00:00:47,137
And a Verifier, plain code, recomputes every number from the event log: Vantry's passes into the final third went from four to fourteen.

9
00:00:47,600 --> 00:00:49,629
Then it personalises.

10
00:00:49,649 --> 00:00:55,757
Pick your club, and the same checked moment is told from your side, in English, Chinese or Spanish.

11
00:00:55,757 --> 00:00:59,849
Follow a player, and Pivot keeps that player in focus all match.

12
00:01:00,600 --> 00:01:02,900
And you can ask: what if?

13
00:01:02,920 --> 00:01:07,708
Pivot saves the match at that minute and replays the rest two hundred times each way.

14
00:01:07,708 --> 00:01:11,693
A fan gets their team's biggest what-ifs, in one line.

15
00:01:11,693 --> 00:01:16,976
An analyst gets the effect with its ninety-five percent range, and whether the difference is clear.

16
00:01:18,800 --> 00:01:27,349
After full time, analysts get the deep dive: match phases, game state, shot quality, attacking lanes and style percentiles.

17
00:01:29,300 --> 00:01:35,739
The agents run on Azure AI Foundry and Microsoft Agent Framework, with results in Cosmos DB.

18
00:01:35,759 --> 00:01:38,400
Every club and player is synthetic.

19
00:01:38,400 --> 00:01:40,075
This is Pivot.
